      "writtenOn": "2022-11-04T22:25:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unsurprisingly, it turns out that Tom was right in the beginning. I can override the `COSNOLE_TASK_STACK_SIZE` variable from within the tasklist file like this:\n\n```\n#undef CONSOLE_TASK_STACK_SIZE\n#define CONSOLE_TASK_STACK_SIZE 8192\n```\n\nWith that in mind I\u0027ll just revert this and use the tasklist option that Tom originally proposed.",
